@startuml UC10_Sequence
!theme plain

title UC10 - Upgrade Subscription Sequence

actor Customer as C
participant "Subscription Service" as Sub
participant "Payment Service" as Pay
participant "Subscription Repository" as DB

C -> Sub : POST /subscription/upgrade
Sub -> Sub : Validate target tier
Sub -> Pay : Create payment
Pay --> Sub : payment success
Sub -> DB : Update subscription
DB --> Sub : saved
Sub --> C : 200 upgrade success
Sub -> Sub : Activate new features

note right of Sub
  Mock payment for MVP
  Real integration TBD
end note

@enduml